pkg:Evidence_v1_47_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.47.0 (STORY-16 formally closed, found stale during a status check)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: owner asked directly whether any tasks/stories remained. Queried the real register rather than answering from memory: found STORY-10 and STORY-18 genuinely, correctly open, and STORY-16 stale -- its own real scope had actually been completed several turns ago (198 to 0 violations, re-confirmed CONFORMANT after every subsequent framework upgrade since) but was never formally transitioned to Done, still showing a REMAINING-146 breakdown that no longer reflected reality. Closed it properly: real AcceptanceCriterion, ReleaseEvidence citing the real last-published hash, TestHarness, an honestly-low-confidence retrospective CostEstimate (never scoped up front), real design-concern judgement, and a real PlanningEvent dated at the actual moment the gap was first disclosed. Re-confirmed the two now-stale WSJF scores. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS (67 subjects, reproduces), register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "23a6426299c1348f08f6c261bbad3d49c1f0bbd1b1752bdff31721b6e78855a0"^^xsd:string .
